{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "displayName": "breaches",
      "name": "freshness_slos__breaches",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, `dataset`, `key`, `age_hours`, `error_hours`, `tier`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`ops_freshness`\n",
        "WHERE `breach` = TRUE\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "breaches daily",
      "name": "freshness_slos__breaches_daily",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `day`, MEASURE(`breaches`) AS `breaches`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_freshness`\n",
        "WHERE `breach` = TRUE\n",
        "GROUP BY `day`\n",
        "ORDER BY `day`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "displayName": "slo",
      "name": "freshness_slos__slo",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `dataset`, MEASURE(`met_pct`) AS `met_pct`\n",
        "FROM `dev_ops`.`ops`.`mv_ops_slo`\n",
        "GROUP BY `dataset`\n",
        "ORDER BY `dataset`"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "displayName": "Freshness and SLOs",
      "layout": [
        {
          "position": {
            "height": 2,
            "width": 6,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "widget": {
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "## Freshness and SLOs\n",
                "\n",
                "Is the data as fresh as each dataset's contract promises? Breaches of the manifest's own targets, per dataset and per feed, and how often each target was met. Learned freshness and completeness alerts per table are the platform's anomaly detection (adopted, not rebuilt); this screen keeps only the promised targets it cannot know.\n",
                "\n",
                "Owned by observability. Built from the ops metric views over the compact ops tables (run log, daily telemetry copy, freshness, alerts), joined by run id. Discharges DPC-0057, FRESH-01, OPS-01, LATE-01."
              ]
            },
            "name": "about"
          }
        },
        {
